      "size" : 12,
      "text" : "BUS Card and Option select. This\nlets the user select the card’s\naddress and decodes the function\nor option for the card.\n\n U1 | U2 | U2 | Total |\n----|----|----|-------|\n 8  | 12 |    |  20   | /OP#\n 8  |    | 8  |  16   | D1\n\nAt 20ns worst case the 4 /OP#\nsignals are ready.\nD1 is active when card is\nselected.",
